cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GaiaSeis, please cite it as below. Results obtained with the optional PPPH-VA engine path must also cite Bahadur, Bezcioglu & Yigit (GPS Solutions 28:31, 2024)."
type: software
title: "GaiaSeis: GNSS-based real-time seismogeodesy platform"
version: 0.5.0
date-released: 2026-10-30
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/PanagiotisElias/GaiaSeis"
url: "https://github.com/PanagiotisElias/GaiaSeis"
