keywords:
  - GNSS
  - seismogeodesy
  - real-time
  - NTRIP
  - RTCM
  - variometric approach
  - miniSEED
  - SeedLink
  - Julia
abstract: >-
  GaiaSeis connects to NTRIP casters, decodes RTCM 3 observation and
  ephemeris streams, groups each receiver epoch and hands it to a
  displacement engine plug-in (default: GaiaVario, a variometric engine),
  and publishes the displacement time series as miniSEED files, a SeedLink
  feed (through ringserver), a web page and a GTK GUI. Developed within the
  TRANSFORM² project (European Union, project number 101188365).
